.TH DISK-CLEANER-MCP 1 "November 2026" "Disk Cleaner MCP 0.3.0"
.SH NAME
disk-cleaner-mcp \- Rust MCP server: fast safe disk cleanup for AI agents
.SH SYNOPSIS
disk-cleaner-mcp [--http [PORT]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Serves MCP protocol over stdio (default). With --http (optional feature), serves Streamable HTTP on loopback (default port 8000) at /mcp.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
--http [PORT]
Enable HTTP transport on 127.0.0.1. Default port 8000.
.SH ENTIRONMENT
.TP
DISK_CLEANER_TELEMETRY
Set to 1 to enable opt-in local metrics reporting. No network calls.
.SH SAFETY
Deletes go to Trash by default. Permanent delete requires permanent + confirmPermanent. All deletes require approvalToken per scan.
